{title: Three Alike Verses}
{artist: setDING}
{key: A}
{capo: 2}
{tempo: 80}

{start_of_verse: label="Verse 1"}
[G]The first verse sings a[C]bout the morning
[Em]the light that falls a[D]cross the floor
[G]the coffee and the [C]little worries
[D]and nothing [G]more
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus: label="Chorus"}
[C]And all stays just [G]the way it was
[Am]one more day goes [D]by because
{end_of_chorus}

{start_of_verse: label="Verse 2"}
[G]The second verse sings [C]of the noon time
[Em]the noise in every [D]little street
[G]the bread, a nap, a [C]short and soon time
[D]right at your [G]feet
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: label="Verse 3"}
[G]The third verse sings a[C]bout the evening
[Em]the way back home a[D]gainst the wind
[G]of all the things we [C]keep believing
[D]the way we've [G]been
{end_of_verse}

{chorus}
